{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：19:00 2026-09-04 HKT</p>\n\n<p>現年37歲的前TVB小花陳渃晴（Kaka、原名：陳亭嘉），早前到馬爾代夫旅行享受美景，即使旅程已完結仍未分享完美照。一向不吝嗇晒好身材的她，今日（4日）再於IG分享了一張極度吸睛的泳照。照片中，陳渃晴身穿一套鮮豔的粉紅色三點式比堅尼，騎在巨型粉紅鶴浮床上，於泳池中飄盪並擺出寫意Pose，白滑肌膚、豐滿上圍與S形纖腰線條一覽無遺，性感指數爆燈。雖然已是兩子之母，但她身上零贅肉，火辣身材羨煞旁人，完美演繹何謂「時尚辣媽」。</p>\n<h2>陳渃晴入TVB五年 離巢後發展更好</h2>\n<p>陳渃晴畢業於第24期無綫電視藝員訓練班，曾在TVB效力5年，參演超過50部劇集，但多為閒角，如《怒火街頭2》的妓女，星途平平。2014年她決心離巢，並於2018年參加ViuTV真人騷《Good Night Show 廣告女皇》，憑藉姣好身材和出色表現成飄蕩功入屋，近年更轉型為KOL，事業更上一層樓，吸金力強。</p>\n<img alt=\"前TVB小花陳渃晴一向不吝嗇晒好身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44ff2e271c5f804fb38bed54f2ce5a99/2026-09/kakachan_0827_1784968457_3948923676708036379_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴IG有很多性感泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b531debaae7e0a96911a8e0e0aaa69aa/2026-09/kakachan_0827_1787756809_3972311710102875081_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴去完旅行，美照有排Po！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f0f5278748bb0a99d69ac297f88c57d2/2026-09/kakachan_0827_1787303032_3968506073329821944_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴闊太生活好寫意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bfdc07b0e54721bb78ad8300464ca239/2026-09/kakachan_0827_1786200309_3959256951401912859_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴再度分享泳照，可見她穿上三點式泳裝騎在巨型粉紅鶴浮床上，於泳池中飄盪並擺出寫意Pose。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4966adcf04ba385f6fa2382a0d06364d/2026-09/kakachan_0827_1788505324_3978592142566039969_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴是第24期無綫電視藝員訓練班學員，畢業後加入TVB。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/977c2d6178fb9a512419598df5078828/2025-06/kaka_44_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴曾是TVB小花。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5d5afd498a0ae2f352cad654950e704f/2025-06/kaka_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴星運平平，未見有代表作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5733ea764c5f43219c20319e1fb4e716/2024-10/KAKA_61_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴嫁入豪門生活無憂，早前曾分享性感照賀結婚10周年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/641b1a8e94384e7e38eb8d2dc3ccac63/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1781508939_3919898927512297211_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴與餐飲才俊老公Joe Wong迎來結婚10周年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6a0c9c06ac8bfdf7c22b619a405be965/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1781508939_3919898934390841904_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴與老公特意前往馬爾代夫享受二人世界。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1403748516a4f0b1c4c7fce690b229e3/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1781508939_3919898940665704741_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴於TVB長做閒角離巢後一度彈起。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27b7d230f230783a6a4b621c2559a4cf/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1762610116_3761368737971928571_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴近年已成為KOL。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8898e722c12c1f2e304eede88414e294/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1768054959_3807043388450236067_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴熱愛運動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb17cc0de3d47615bd8288b58f8ae711/2024-10/266501125_1056958578436832_1590910042607183712_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴動靜皆宜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f767e4f7286ae2aedb965b5ad323a16/2024-10/KAKA_98_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴偶然會參與跳舞工作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3bee6777089e903ac0f6006f87526de2/2024-10/KAKA_99_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>陳渃晴與餐飲才俊育有兩子</h2>\n<p>事業得意，陳渃晴的婚姻生活亦同樣美滿。她與餐飲才俊老公Joe Wong結婚10年，婚後誕下兩名兒子，一家四口定居獨立屋，過著幸福無憂的闊太生活。從她不時分享的性感美照可見，陳渃晴對身材管理從不鬆懈，狀態甚至比從前更勇，自信地展示完美曲線，活出所有女性都嚮往的美麗人生。</p>\n<h2>陳渃晴更多性感火辣照逐張睇：</h2>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴曾效力TVB，不過演的角色相當不起眼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/526f0f318cb700043e7e19d35e7b3fe2/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1771849246_3838871437399280749_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴離開TVB後，曾參加ViuTV節目《Good Night Show 廣告女皇》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/67a4675235caa36b7a2e22fdf7ee8d13/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1773550724_3853144578522829474_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴現身ViuTV節目《Good Night Show 廣告女皇》一度引起討論。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/36d5faed187ddafa11b6c2dd7d107d43/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1773897137_3856050399338515343_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴婚後生了兩個小朋友，但身材仍非常好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/421fb3c4803035d56e480ae154c64609/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1777015648_3882209152718835068_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴老公是生意人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/08e89ad6ffb3e628b324c6aa85f79c1a/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1778080991_3891145715221736380_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴婚後生活無憂，住豪宅之外，更時常吃喝玩樂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fd25c4e702f8225abdd8b1d24a30edb0/2026-06/kakachan_0827_1781365635_3918700102256770372_222104750.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴在綜藝節目《千奇百趣高B班》擔任助手「粉刷」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/474594c66d6c88d9e2fe08b6309e9c71/2024-10/cap_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴（左）在綜藝節目《千奇百趣高B班》擔任助手，較為人有印象。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/52bd624dbdd36a82bf22fea17c6fa4a1/2024-10/cap_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴2014年離開TVB。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d1e33fcd2189bc95bd96904ba8ee7beb/2025-06/kaka_37_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴曾亮相HOY TV節目。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/346354d3799d884170a6df2596a6253e/2024-10/KAKA_111_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴近年轉型做KOL。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/edcc3a3d843202b27ba1f35ffc2d3a1b/2024-10/KAKA_51_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴推廣瑜伽發展。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b2cf161320a0b9fccfc4ea33ffb8fd8a/2024-10/KAKA_52_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴婚後過得富貴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d6830f22e1c45848d063e68e6c714209/2024-10/KAKA_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴經常度假。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e1a55e7413ee1ec0b49580cb57209581/2024-10/KAKA_25_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴有一雙長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/73bdba23f95c572a32354fa963f1b781/2024-10/KAKA_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴身材好澎湃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d47b7deabd8507db36ff858285eb969/2024-10/KAKA_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴毫不吝惜晒身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/37e71d399ebb4d279770b6bb83a1a5f9/2024-10/KAKA_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴的IG有大量水著相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/705793c33c0327969848166c2f9b4b4d/2024-10/KAKA_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴身材很好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b61f72544fd1bc13f5ce15e1d5bc584/2024-10/KAKA_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳渃晴經常去旅行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a6ed6fa6b3f13d77c167134eef183d2b/2024-10/KAKA_19_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T11:19:59.466858+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":574,"images":36,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}